    },
    {
      "start": 62.0,
      "end": 81.12,
      "text": "What are the updates, tell me a little bit about the AI integration for the management part, what are the options that can be used in that?"
    },
    {
      "start": 81.12,
      "end": 91.3,
      "text": "Let me tell you, first of all, we see that the business operations, the work flows, which may be manual,"
    },
    {
      "start": 92.1,
      "end": 94.92,
      "text": "even if it is done through the computer, it takes a lot of time."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.14,
      "end": 97.84,
      "text": "First of all, we see that the attendance management has been done."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.5,
      "end": 101.1,
      "text": "If you send reports, that can happen."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.1,
      "end": 106.96,
      "text": "and then we can make an AI module out of the exam."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.96,
      "end": 113.2,
      "text": "You will upload a picture and it will tell the marks of the student."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.68,
      "end": 117.84,
      "text": "It will give us the rules and regulations."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.52,
      "end": 119.86,
      "text": "It has all the knowledge."
